{
  "content": {
    "en_us": "Biofuel can be obtained by combining [[biogas|Biogas]] and [[ethanol|Ethanol]] in a [[chemical plant|Chemical Plant]]. It is primarily used as a combustion [[fuel|Fuels]] for supplemental power production.",
